abstract: >-
  A reproducible C99 implementation of all four Statistical Ineffective
  Persistent Fault Analysis scenarios on the SCENERY-64/80 lightweight
  Feistel block cipher, including tests, datasets, repeated experiments,
  and publication-ready artifacts.
